    },
    {
      "text": "Sift confectioners' sugar and cocoa powder into a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G2hJCMvkVM5Dw5P8I9ALvWlqlMY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-26019-creamy-chocolate-frosting-step-02-5cb446f1ad5349a3b3a5d299831ae0c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26019/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter in a large bowl with an electric mixer until smooth and fluffy. Gradually beat in sugar mixture alternately with evaporated milk until well combined; blend in vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9CsrkBSuk2z_Fdi89C21XmXoHEc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-26019-creamy-chocolate-frosting-step-03-edf33ca5579546e7acd2f8a3b1fbfc11.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26019/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat mixture on high speed until light and fluffy. Adjust consistency with more milk or sugar, if desired.",
